    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "a_sch_office03_eve04",
      "hash64": "8F5DA9DBF978582A",
      "text": "要是宝可梦受伤了，\\n去医务室就能得到治疗。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "a_sch_office03_eve07",
      "hash64": "8F5DA8DBF9785677",
      "text": "在班里遇到不开心的事后，\\n我就会在这里休息。\\c\\n……米莫莎老师什么都不问，\\n很温柔的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "a_sch_office03_ni01",
      "hash64": "5CB3DF5C0B29144A",
      "text": "学生会用“米磨砂子”这个外号\\n叫米莫莎老师！\\r\\n……我和她本人说了之后，被她瞪了一眼！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
